      "label": "a man holding a rifle",
      "description": "A man with short dark hair, wearing a dark hoodie with a plaid-lined hood, is standing indoors and aiming a black rifle-like object out of a window. He appears focused and is holding the weapon with both hands, suggesting readiness or anticipation. His posture and the direction of his gaze indicate he is targeting something outside the window.",
