      "instance_name": "aiming_out_window",
      "label": "person aiming rifle out of window",
      "description": "A man is standing indoors, holding a rifle-like object with both hands and aiming it out of an open window. He is focused and appears ready to engage, symbolizing anticipation or readiness for action. The scene is framed by the window and the interior wall, with text overlay providing context about gaming culture.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
